   "logline": "Li Shiqing repeatedly wakes on the same bus moments before a Canon ringtone signals a violent crash, gradually realizing she is trapped in a cycle and trying to convince the hesitant driver to stop by pretending to be ill.",
   "brief": "CHARACTERS:\n- Li Shiqing: A young Chinese female university student with black hair and black eyes, approximately 20 years old, fair-skinned with delicate features. She has long black hair and wears simple university attire—a blue denim shirt paired with jeans.\n- Bus Driver Uncle: A middle-aged man in his 40s with graying hair, medium build, and a kind face. His hair is somewhat thinning, and he wears the uniform of a bus driver—a blue shirt.\n\nSHOTS (15 total):\n1. [Daytime, inside the bus, a quiet atmosphere, scattered passengers in their seats, flowing city scenery outside the window, soft natural lighting] As usual, Li Shiqing fell asleep on the bus. Li Shiqing sits by the window, her head resting against it, her expression peaceful with closed eyes, a backpack placed on her lap Camera: Full shot, eye level shot. Characters: Li Shiqing.\n2. [Daytime, inside the bus, a quiet atmosphere, scattered passengers in their seats, flowing city scenery outside the window, soft natural lighting] Suddenly, she was awakened by the sound of a Canon ringtone. Li Shiqing slightly opens her eyes, her expression somewhat dazed, her hand reaching into her pocket as the Canon ringtone plays from it Camera: Medium close up, eye level shot. Characters: Li Shiqing.\n3. [Daytime, inside the bus, a chaotic atmosphere, panicked passengers, items scattered everywhere, strong sunlight streaming through the windows] However, the bus suddenly experienced a violent collision, and she promptly fainted. Li Shiqing leans forward, her expression terrified, her hands attempting to grasp the handrail in front of her but failing, her head hitting the seat in front as she faints Camera: Medium shot, low-angle shot. Characters: Li Shiqing.\n4. [Daytime, inside the bus, a quiet atmosphere, scattered passengers in their seats, flowing city scenery outside the window, soft natural lighting] When she woke up, everything seemed perfectly normal. Li Shiqing sits by the window, slowly opening her eyes, her expression confused as she looks around—everything appears normal Camera: Full shot, eye level shot. Characters: Li Shiqing.\n5. [Daytime, inside the bus, a quiet atmosphere, scattered passengers in their seats, flowing city scenery outside the window, soft natural lighting] But when that damned phone rang again, the nightmare returned once more. Li Shiqing's expression is tense as her hand reaches into her pocket again; the Canon ringtone plays once more, her eyes widening in terror Camera: Medium close up, eye level shot. Characters: Li Shiqing.\n6. [Daytime, inside the bus, a chaotic atmosphere, panicked passengers, items scattered everywhere, strong sunlight streaming through the windows] The bus made a sharp turn, passengers screamed as they were thrown from their seats, and Li Shiqing was no exception. The bus takes a sharp turn; passengers scream as they are thrown from their seats. Li Shiqing loses her balance, her expression terrified as she tries to grab an outstretched hand nearby Camera: Medium shot, low-angle shot. Characters: Li Shiqing.\n7. [Daytime, inside the bus, a chaotic atmosphere, panicked passengers, items scattered everywhere, strong sunlight streaming through the windows] She tried to grab a nearby handrail but failed, her head hitting the ground hard. Li Shiqing's hand flails in the air, attempting to grab the nearby handrail but failing; the back of her head hits the ground hard, her expression pained as her eyes close Camera: Close up, eye level shot. Characters: Li Shiqing.\n8. [Daytime, inside the bus, a quiet atmosphere, scattered passengers in their seats, flowing city scenery outside the window, soft natural lighting] Upon 'waking up' for the third time, Li Shiqing realized something was wrong. Li Shiqing sits by the window, slowly opening her eyes, her expression confused and solemn, her hand clutching her head as if recalling the previous 'nightmare' Camera: Full shot, eye level shot. Characters: Li Shiqing.\n9. [Daytime, inside the bus, a tense atmosphere, passengers watching Li Shiqing curiously, flowing city scenery outside the window, soft natural lighting] She tried to get the driver to stop, but he refused, fearing an accident if he stopped outside a designated stop. Li Shiqing stands next to the driver, her expression anxious, her hand gripping his seat. The Bus Driver Uncle turns his head, his expression hesitant as he shakes it slightly Camera: Medium shot, eye level shot. Characters: Li Shiqing, Bus Driver Uncle.\n10. [Daytime, inside the bus, a chaotic atmosphere, panicked passengers, items scattered everywhere, strong sunlight streaming through the windows] Just then, the phone rang again, and the bus met with another accident. The Canon ringtone plays again; Li Shiqing's expression is terrified as the bus suddenly takes a sharp turn. Passengers scream as they are thrown from their seats, and Li Shiqing is no exception Camera: Medium shot, low-angle shot. Characters: Li Shiqing.\n11. [Daytime, inside the bus, a quiet atmosphere, scattered passengers in their seats, flowing city scenery outside the window, soft natural lighting] Upon waking for the fourth time, she decided to act like a 'suddenly ill' weak girl to get the driver to stop. Li Shiqing sits by the window, her expression resolute, her hand clutching her chest as she feigns weakness, slowly standing up Camera: Full shot, eye level shot. Characters: Li Shiqing.\n12. [Daytime, inside the bus, a tense atmosphere, passengers watching Li Shiqing curiously, flowing city scenery outside the window, soft natural lighting] The driver hesitated but eventually agreed. Li Shiqing stands next to the driver, her expression weak, her hand resting on his seat. The Bus Driver Uncle turns his head, his expression hesitant, but he eventually nods Camera: Medium shot, eye level shot. Characters: Li Shiqing, Bus Driver Uncle.\n13. [Daytime, inside the bus, a chaotic atmosphere, panicked passengers, items scattered everywhere, strong sunlight streaming through the windows] However, just as the bus was about to stop, the dreadful phone rang again, and the bus met with another accident. The bus is about to stop when the Canon ringtone plays again. Li Shiqing's expression is terrified as the bus suddenly takes a sharp turn. Passengers scream as they are thrown from their seats, and Li Shiqing is no exception Camera: Medium shot, low-angle shot. Characters: Li Shiqing.\n14. [Daytime, inside the bus, a quiet atmosphere, scattered passengers in their seats, flowing city scenery outside the window, soft natural lighting] Li Shiqing refused to give up. She vowed that next time, she would hold onto something tightly to avoid getting hurt again. Li Shiqing sits by the window, her expression resolute and unwilling to concede, her hands clenched into fists, her eyes filled with determination Camera: Close up, eye level shot. Characters: Li Shiqing.\n15. [Daytime, inside the bus, a quiet atmosphere, scattered passengers in their seats, flowing city scenery outside the window, soft natural lighting] Li Shiqing stared ahead, ready to face the next challenge. Li Shiqing sits by the window, leaning slightly forward, her expression focused and determined, her hands gripping the handrail tightly, ready to face the next challenge Camera: Medium close up, eye level shot. Characters: Li Shiqing.",
